{"id":"5a8a4d0477","t":"Contract Admissions","c":"cv","n":27,"l":27,"s":["ml","mg","az","mg"],"k":{"ml":"contract-admissions","mg":"contract-admissions","az":"contract-admissions"},"u":1795078949737,"desc":"“ريو كانغ مين”، عضوٌ في منظمة الاغتيالات الضخمة “باتالا”؛ ذلك العرين المرّوع المُصفّد للنّفس والنّاس؛ فمَن دخله فقد خطّ نهاية حريته؛ ولا سبيل للخروج منه مطلقًا. ​وفي أحد الأيام، يلوح له بريق أملٍ حين يتلقى مهمةً استثنائية، ثمنها الغالي المقابل هو نيل “الحرية”. ​فحوى هذه المهمة يتلخص في تصفية هدفٍ محددٍ داخل كوريا. ولأجل تحقيق هذه الغاية، يعود إلى أرض الوطن، ويبدأ أولًا بالتخلص من “خائن” المنظمة كخطوةٍ تمهيدية لشحذ مهاراته واستعادة لياقته. ​وما إن يفرغ من هذا الإحماء الخاطف، حتى يشرع بكل حسمٍ في غمار مهمته الكبرى…","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","تشويق"],"src":{"ml":"contract-admissions","mg":"contract-admissions","az":"contract-admissions"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/1/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/2/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-2"},"3":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/3/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-3"},"4":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/4/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-4"},"5":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/5/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-5"},"6":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/6/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-6"},"7":{"ml":"contract-admissions|/manga/contract-admissions/7/","mg":"contract-admissions|","az":"contract-admissions|/series/contract-admissions/chapter-7"},"8":{"ml":"